			"notes": "**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Garkatron/BTA-PainScale/compare/1.0.3...1.0.5\n\n**Changelog:**\n\n* Fixed a bug in `addPoints()` that caused the player’s earned points to reset incorrectly.\n* Added two UI components to display the current level and the progress percentage toward the next level.\n* Added configuration options in the menu to control the visibility of these two components.\n* Improved the `.cfg` configuration system with version control: a backup of the previous configuration is stored in a special folder within `config/` if the version does not match the one required by the mod, and the configuration is recreated using the default settings.\n* Removed unnecessary debug prints.\n* Etc"
